(655, 1, 'foa-52184', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Louis Philippe Bed | FM7866WH', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/louis-philippe-52184.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-52184-louis-philippe-bed-fm7866wh/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-52184-louis-philippe-bed-fm7866wh/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-52184-louis-philippe-bed-fm7866wh/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-52184-louis-philippe-bed-fm7866wh/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-52184-louis-philippe-bed-fm7866wh/5.jpg', 'Style your master bedroom however you like with this classic collection, featuring a sleigh bed design with matching multi-storage case goods, all with an identical White finish. The night stand, chest and dresser allow you to store clothes, bedding and any other items. Bring a unique taste to your bedroom while creating a relaxing and stylish environment.\n• Transitional\n• White\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Sleigh Design\n• Hanging Drawer Pulls\n• Dust Proof Case\n• English Dovetail Drawer\n• Bracket Feet\n• Foundation Required', 329.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:07:43', '2026-10-07 04:07:43'),
(656, 1, 'foa-52443', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Louis Philippe Bed | FM7866GY', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/louis-philippe-52443.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-52443-louis-philippe-bed-fm7866gy/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-52443-louis-philippe-bed-fm7866gy/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-52443-louis-philippe-bed-fm7866gy/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-52443-louis-philippe-bed-fm7866gy/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-52443-louis-philippe-bed-fm7866gy/5.jpg', '• Transitional\n• Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Sleigh Design\n• Hanging Drawer Pulls\n• Dust Proof Case\n• English Dovetail Drawer\n• Bracket Feet\n• Foundation Required', 329.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:07:44', '2026-10-07 04:07:44'),
(657, 1, 'foa-51721', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Manzanillo Bed | CM7470BL', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/manzanillo-51721.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51721-manzanillo-bed-cm7470bl/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51721-manzanillo-bed-cm7470bl/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51721-manzanillo-bed-cm7470bl/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51721-manzanillo-bed-cm7470bl/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51721-manzanillo-bed-cm7470bl/5.jpg', 'Gorgeous lines and a grand silhouette give this bedroom furniture a distinctive edge. The tall, panel headboard commands attention, while the nickel hardware which comes in knobs and cup pulls adds a slight sense of fancy. At the foot of the bed are two full-extension drawers--perfect to store extra linen sheets and pillows. Molding details on each case good\'s front give it a country twist that\'s amplified by the bold slate blue finish.\n• Transitional\n• Slate Blue\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Panel Headboard w/ Molding Details\n• Footbard Drawers w/ Full-extension Glides\n• Ball-bearing Glides for Case Good Drawers\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer\n• Nickel Round Knobs and Cup Pulls\n• Mattress Ready', 1379.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:07:45', '2026-10-07 04:07:45'),
(658, 1, 'foa-51729', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Durango Bed | CM7461GY', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/durango-51729.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51729-durango-bed-cm7461gy/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51729-durango-bed-cm7461gy/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51729-durango-bed-cm7461gy/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51729-durango-bed-cm7461gy/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51729-durango-bed-cm7461gy/5.jpg', 'Visually appealing with its regal headboard and intricate molding, this wooden collection is the perfect focal point for any transitional space. Two full-extension drawers on the footboard offer indispensable storage space. Every groove and detail of the beautifully wire-brushed wood is reflected on the matching case goods--their drawers made of dovetail construction and features ball bearing mechanism for smooth operation. Bottom drawers are also made of cedar wood to discourage pests and insects. Of note is the nightstand which features a hidden drawer and a USB port for overnight charging.\n• Transitional\n• Warm Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Wire-brushed Finish\n• Dovetail Drawers\n• Felt-lined Top and Cedar Wood Bottom Drawers\n• Footbard Drawers w/ Full extension Glides\n• Ball-bearing Glides for Case Good Drawers\n• USB Port and Hidden Drawer on Nightstand\n• Foundation Required', 1289.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:07:46', '2026-10-07 04:07:46'),
(659, 1, 'foa-51745', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Vagan Bed | CM7472GY', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/vagan-51745.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51745-vagan-bed-cm7472gy/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51745-vagan-bed-cm7472gy/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51745-vagan-bed-cm7472gy/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51745-vagan-bed-cm7472gy/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51745-vagan-bed-cm7472gy/5.jpg', 'Something about this bed\'s cool gray finish and chevron grain pattern gives it a stylish vibe. The diagonal replicated grain meet at the center line, forming a V-shaped pattern found on the headboard and front panels. Contemporary elements continue throughout this ensemble, with the black angled legs and sleek finger pulls found on the matching case goods. Coordinating pieces like this set offer a stress-free experience in updating your bedroom decor.\n• Contemporary\n• Gray\n• Solid Wood, Paper Veneer, Others\n• Chevron Pattern\n• Replicated Wood Grain\n• Black Angled Wooden Legs\n• Black Finger Pulls\n• Foundation Required', 659.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:07:47', '2026-10-07 04:07:47'),
(660, 1, 'foa-51753', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Esparanza Bed | CM7478CH', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/esparanza-51753.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51753-esparanza-bed-cm7478ch/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51753-esparanza-bed-cm7478ch/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51753-esparanza-bed-cm7478ch/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51753-esparanza-bed-cm7478ch/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51753-esparanza-bed-cm7478ch/5.jpg', 'If luxury is a necessity for the bedroom, then this bedroom set is a must-have. The sheer size of the headboard and footboard is a sight to behold. Button tufted leatherette centerpieces are framed by intricate faux wood carved details exuding baroque influences. The case goods are a wonder as well--both nightstand and dresser share genuine marble tops, beautiful and unique for each piece. All drawers are dovetail construction--the top drawer feature felt-lining, middle drawer are birch, and bottom drawers made of cedar wood, a natural insect repellant. With all its lavish offerings, to say this traditional set is over-the-top would be a gross understatement.\n• Traditional\n• Brown Cherry\n• Leatherette, Marble, Polyresin, Solid Wood, Others\n• Button-tufted Headboard\n• Faux Wood Carved Details\n• Genuine Marble Top on Nightstand and Dresser\n• Felt-lined Top\n• Birch Middle\n• and Cedar Bottom Drawers\n• Ball-bearing Glides', 1799.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:07:49', '2026-10-07 04:07:49'),
(661, 1, 'foa-51761', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Esparanza Bed | CM7478WH', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/esparanza-51761.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51761-esparanza-bed-cm7478wh/1.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1799.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 04:09:20', '2026-10-07 04:09:20'),
(662, 1, 'foa-51769', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Dortmund Bed | CM7465WH', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/dortmund-51769.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51769-dortmund-bed-cm7465wh/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51769-dortmund-bed-cm7465wh/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51769-dortmund-bed-cm7465wh/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51769-dortmund-bed-cm7465wh/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51769-dortmund-bed-cm7465wh/5.jpg', 'This modern bedroom group sets itself apart through simple design with a few delightful twists. It starts with the clean white finish--a classic element that thrives when paired with subtle yet impactful details. Look closely and you\'ll notice the wave texture found on the headboard, footboard, and front panels of each of the matching case goods, beautifully framed by moldings with mitered angles. Finally, angled legs and gorgeous lines add contemporary flair to this ensemble\'s sleek silhouette.\n• Contemporary\n• White\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Mitered Corner Design\n• Wave Texture\n• Angled Legs on Case Goods\n• Bronze Round Knobs\n• Foundation Required', 539.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:09:22', '2026-10-07 04:09:22'),
(663, 1, 'foa-50751', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Rosabelle Bed | CM7669BK', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/rosabelle-50751.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50751-rosabelle-bed-cm7669bk/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50751-rosabelle-bed-cm7669bk/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50751-rosabelle-bed-cm7669bk/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50751-rosabelle-bed-cm7669bk/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50751-rosabelle-bed-cm7669bk/5.jpg', 'Charming and simple, this fabric bed suits all styles and will surely become a versatile piece to be cherished for years to come. The timeless, wingback headboard curves in ever so slightly and is button-tufted in a beautiful diamond pattern. Meanwhile, edges are lined with nailhead trim to add a touch of visual interest while maintaining the clean, classic look with its velvet-like upholstery.\n• Transitional\n• Black\n• Velvet-Like Fabric, Solid Wood, Others\n• Wingback Headboard\n• Padded Flannelette\n• Button Tufted Headboard w/ Nailhead Trim\n• Foundation Required', 1139.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:09:23', '2026-10-07 04:09:23'),
(664, 1, 'foa-51543', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Castile Bed | CM7413WH', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/castile-51543.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51543-castile-bed-cm7413wh/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51543-castile-bed-cm7413wh/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51543-castile-bed-cm7413wh/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51543-castile-bed-cm7413wh/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51543-castile-bed-cm7413wh/5.jpg', 'Take serenity home with this complete bedroom set from the Castile collection. Topped with beautiful crown molding details, the bold panel headboard and tall footboard are window pane-inspired with a mattress ready platform. The side rails feature large drawers lined with felt for extra storage space. Finally, the finish and the nickel cup pulls and round knobs complement each other well in tone and hue.\n• Transitional\n• White\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Crown Molding Details\n• Cup Pulls and Round Knobs\n• Side Rail Drawers\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer and Cedarlined Bottom Drawer\n• Full-extension Ball Bearing Glides\n• USB Port on Night Stand\n• Mattress Ready', 1199.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:09:24', '2026-10-07 04:09:24'),
(665, 1, 'foa-51561', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Raiden Bed | CM7468GY', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/raiden-51561.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51561-raiden-bed-cm7468gy/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51561-raiden-bed-cm7468gy/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51561-raiden-bed-cm7468gy/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51561-raiden-bed-cm7468gy/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51561-raiden-bed-cm7468gy/5.jpg', 'This beautiful bedroom set is the perfect way to illuminate any space. A strip of white LED light is hidden behind the headboard and footboard panel, resulting to a visually stunning glow around the rectangular centerpieces. The same is true with the matching mirror. The reflected light blends beautifully with the rest of the ensemble, which features a brushed gray finish and a semi-matte look. Finally, chrome bracket legs allow the light to bounce off more for a potentially dazzling set.\n• Transitional\n• Gray\n• Metal, Solid Wood, Others\n• White LED on Headboard, Footboard & Mirror\n• 2 USB-A and 1 USB-C Ports on Night Stand\n• Ball Bearing Glides\n• Bar Handles\n• Felt-lined Top & Cedar Bottom Drawers\n• Metal Bracket Legs\n• Foundation Required', 1499.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:09:25', '2026-10-07 04:09:25'),
(666, 1, 'foa-5', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Vivar Bed | CM7220BG', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/vivar-5.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-5-vivar-bed-cm7220bg/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-5-vivar-bed-cm7220bg/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-5-vivar-bed-cm7220bg/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-5-vivar-bed-cm7220bg/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-5-vivar-bed-cm7220bg/5.jpg', 'Bring back the vintage appeal of yesteryear’s Hollywood with this art decoinspired piece. The simple frame with gold-plated legs accentuates the main focus of this bed—the beautiful chevron tufted headboard. The frame is wrapped in soft beige fabric all around for a piece that seems to be pulled out of history but gracefully updated for modern times.\n• Mid-century Modern\n• Beige\n• Flannelette, Others\n• Chevron Tufted Design\n• Padded Headboard\n• Fully Upholstered\n• Angled Gold Legs', 569.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:09:27', '2026-10-07 04:09:27'),
(667, 1, 'foa-51043', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Castlile Bed | CM7413GY', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/castlile-51043.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51043-castlile-bed-cm7413gy/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51043-castlile-bed-cm7413gy/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51043-castlile-bed-cm7413gy/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51043-castlile-bed-cm7413gy/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51043-castlile-bed-cm7413gy/5.jpg', 'Take serenity home with this complete bedroom set from the Castile collection. Topped with beautiful crown molding details, the bold panel headboard and tall footboard cradles enough slats in between them for you to easily lay your mattress without the need for a separate foundation. On the sides are large underbed drawers lined with felt. Finally, the gray finish and the nickel cup pulls and round knobs complement each other well in tone and hue.\n• Transitional\n• Gray\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Crown Molding Detail\n• Cup Pulls and Round Knobs\n• Underbed Side Drawers\n• Felt-lined Drawer and Cedar-Lined Bottom Drawer\n• Full-extension Ball Bearing Glides\n• USB Port on Night Stand\n• Mattress Ready', 1259.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:09:28', '2026-10-07 04:09:28'),
(668, 1, 'foa-51051', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Houston Bed | CM7221GY', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/houston-51051.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51051-houston-bed-cm7221gy/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51051-houston-bed-cm7221gy/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51051-houston-bed-cm7221gy/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51051-houston-bed-cm7221gy/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51051-houston-bed-cm7221gy/5.jpg', 'A perfect anchor piece for your master suite, this grand bedroom commands attention. With bold details and intricate crown molding accents, the large, panel style headboard towers over the wooden rubber wood bed frame. Similar crown molding motifs can be found on the case goods. On the hardware side of things, the rustic-inspired appliance bar pulls are finished in a shade of pewter.\n• Traditional\n• Gray\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Panel Style Headboard\n• Crown Molding Details\n• Pewter Bar Pulls\n• Rubber Wood Frame\n• Foundation Required', 779.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:09:29', '2026-10-07 04:09:29'),
(669, 1, 'foa-51128', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Alison Bed | CM7416GY', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/alison-51128.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51128-alison-bed-cm7416gy/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51128-alison-bed-cm7416gy/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51128-alison-bed-cm7416gy/3.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'Illuminate any space with this beautiful bedroom set. A strip of LED light is hidden behind the headboard\'s textured main panel, which results to a visually stunning glow around the rectangular centerpiece. Mysterious and cool at the same time, the light reflects on to each piece of the ensemble, which features a gray finish with a slight sheen. Translucent hardware made of acrylic materials adds to the luminous potential of this dazzling set.\n• Contemporary\n• Metallic Gray\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Textured Headboard Panel w/ LED Lighting\n• Bracket Feet\n• Acrylic Hardware on Case Goods\n• Mattress Ready', 629.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:10:00', '2026-10-07 04:10:00'),
(670, 1, 'foa-51151', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Erlach Bed | FOA7189WH', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/erlach-51151.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51151-erlach-bed-foa7189wh/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51151-erlach-bed-foa7189wh/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51151-erlach-bed-foa7189wh/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51151-erlach-bed-foa7189wh/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51151-erlach-bed-foa7189wh/5.jpg', 'Be ready to set the right mood anytime with this tantalizing bedroom set. The main draw here is of course, the ambient LED lighting lining the bottom edges of the platform bed, reminiscent of neon lights of the olden days. Reflecting light beautifully to add to the daring environment, the chrome accents on the headboard match those of the case goods. Finished in sleek, glossy white, this ensemble is a testament to the enduring allure of futuristic settings amped with nostalgic flair.\n• Contemporary\n• White/Chrome\n• Metal, Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Chrome Accent\n• Low Profile Platform\n• High Gloss Finish\n• Bracket Feet\n• Chrome Bar Pulls\n• Embedded LED Light', 959.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:10:01', '2026-10-07 04:10:01'),
(671, 1, 'foa-51167', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Florizel Bed | CM7411RD', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/florizel-51167.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51167-florizel-bed-cm7411rd/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51167-florizel-bed-cm7411rd/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51167-florizel-bed-cm7411rd/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51167-florizel-bed-cm7411rd/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51167-florizel-bed-cm7411rd/5.jpg', 'Coming in a bold color, this bed stays true to its glam roots. Between the classy, shell tufting and the gold-coated steel legs, it is designed for the sophisticated urbanite and their modern city oasis. The thick and padded headboard and footboard are upholstered in soft flannelette, so are the side rails and the rest of the piece--luxury and comfort rolled into one stunning product.\n• Glam\n• Red/Gold\n• Flannelette, Steel, Others\n• Shell Tufting\n• Padded Headboard\n• Fully Upholstered\n• Gold-coated Steel Legs', 959.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:10:02', '2026-10-07 04:10:02'),
