(673, 1, 'foa-51202', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Leomin Bed | CM7241GY', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/leomin-51202.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51202-leomin-bed-cm7241gy/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51202-leomin-bed-cm7241gy/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51202-leomin-bed-cm7241gy/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51202-leomin-bed-cm7241gy/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51202-leomin-bed-cm7241gy/5.jpg', 'Some mid-century flair combined with classic elements--that\'s what the Leomin bed is all about. Low profile, angled legs, and a simple silhouette all fit the bill of a piece from the buy-gone era of the 40\'s and 50\'s. The padded headboard and biscuit tufting pull from familiar transitional influences. The result is a bed that\'s worthy of a spot in your own personal space.\n• Mid-century Modern\n• Gray\n• Fabric, Solid Wood, Others\n• Low Profile Bed\n• Padded Fabric Headboard\n• Button Biscuit Tufting\n• Fully Upholstered\n• Welt Trim\n• Mattress Ready', 869.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:10:04', '2026-10-07 04:10:04'),
(674, 1, 'foa-51238', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Zohar Bed | CM7130PK', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/zohar-51238.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51238-zohar-bed-cm7130pk/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51238-zohar-bed-cm7130pk/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51238-zohar-bed-cm7130pk/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51238-zohar-bed-cm7130pk/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51238-zohar-bed-cm7130pk/5.jpg', 'Showcase your personal taste with this bold statement piece in your bedroom. Fully upholstered in flannelette, this bed features an oversized wingback headboard with eye-catching tufting and lined with nailhead trim. The padded fabric and crystal buttons continue all throughout the bed frame and the matching case goods. Each drawer handle is made of glistening acrylic crystals, while silver-painted cabriole legs are perfect in bringing in majestic vibes that this ensemble set out to do.\n• Glam\n• Pink\n• Velvet-like, Solid Wood, Others\n• Fully Upholstered\n• Wingback Design\n• Button Tufted Headboard\n• Crystal-Like Acrylic Buttons\n• Cabriole Legs', 869.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:10:05', '2026-10-07 04:10:05'),
(675, 1, 'foa-51246', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Pearl Bed | CM7459PK', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/pearl-51246.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51246-pearl-bed-cm7459pk/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51246-pearl-bed-cm7459pk/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51246-pearl-bed-cm7459pk/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51246-pearl-bed-cm7459pk/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-51246-pearl-bed-cm7459pk/5.jpg', 'It\'s the great combination of disparate glam elements that allow this bed to shine. Let\'s start with the headboard--its vertical channel tufting harkens to a few decades back. Edges fold forward to resemble a wing; it\'s another classic element that brings luxury to the piece. The legs are made of metal, plated in a golden color that screams sophistication. Finally, the whole frame is wrapped in soft velvet-like fabric in a color that will make you go, \"Wow!\"\n• Contemporary\n• Light Pink\n• Velvet-like, Metal, Others\n• Channel Tufting\n• Wingback Design\n• Fully Upholstered\n• Gold Metal Legs', 509.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:10:06', '2026-10-07 04:10:06'),
(676, 1, 'foa-50611', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Emmeline Bed | FOA7147WH', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/emmeline-50611.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50611-emmeline-bed-foa7147wh/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50611-emmeline-bed-foa7147wh/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50611-emmeline-bed-foa7147wh/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50611-emmeline-bed-foa7147wh/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50611-emmeline-bed-foa7147wh/5.jpg', 'The enticing combination of glamour and Art Deco has long been attempted, but rarely with such successful results as achieved with this set. It is a visual masterpiece, harkening to the days of Old Hollywood while establishing a rich, dynamic concept for the bedroom. The embroidered padded headboard shines as if illuminated. The jewel-carved faux glass feet support the components with regal authority. Classic embossed patterns tie the set together in one magnificent and highly desirable theme.\n• Contemporary\n• White\n• Leatherette, Solid Wood, Others\n• LED Lights in Headboard and Mirror\n• Padded Headboard\n• Embossed Art Deco Pattern\n• Hiddden Jewelry Drawers\n• Acrylic legs\n• USB Charger behind Night Stand', 1799.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:10:07', '2026-10-07 04:10:07'),
(677, 1, 'foa-50620', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Maddie Bed | CM7899SV', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/maddie-50620.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50620-maddie-bed-cm7899sv/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50620-maddie-bed-cm7899sv/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50620-maddie-bed-cm7899sv/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50620-maddie-bed-cm7899sv/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50620-maddie-bed-cm7899sv/5.jpg', 'Create a room with this bedroom set from the Maddie Collection. The curved headboard is padded and upholstered in a horizontally-tufted fabric, emphasizing the silver finish. The night stand, dresser, and chest feature acrylic legs, crystal accents, and a beveled mirror with a LED light creates a glamorous aesthetic. Give into your glitzy side with this opulent set.\n• Contemporary\n• Silver\n• Fabric, Solid Wood, Others\n• Padded Headboard w/ Channel Tufting & LED Light\n• Crystal and Mirror Accents\n• English Dovetail Drawers\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer & Ball-bearing Glides\n• Acrylic Legs\n• Beveled Mirror w/ LED Light\n• Mattress Ready', 1709.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:11:36', '2026-10-07 04:11:36'),
(678, 1, 'foa-50628', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Brachium Bed | CM7977WH', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/brachium-50628.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50628-brachium-bed-cm7977wh/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50628-brachium-bed-cm7977wh/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50628-brachium-bed-cm7977wh/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50628-brachium-bed-cm7977wh/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50628-brachium-bed-cm7977wh/5.jpg', 'Get the most out of your bedroom with this contemporary style bedroom set. The button tufted leatherette headboard offers unlimited comfort so you can lean into it in any angle. The LED light trim on the headboard adds a tasteful sense of convenience for your nightly reading materials. The decorative mirror accents and ornate bun feet compliment these stylish features and the felt-lined top drawers blend traditional elements well.\n• Contemporary\n• White\n• Leatherette, Solid Wood, Others\n• Button Tufted Leatherette Headboard\n• LED Light Trim on Headboard & Mirror\n• Crocodile-Textured Detail\n• Felt-Lined Top Drawers\n• Foundation Required', 1229.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:11:38', '2026-10-07 04:11:38'),
(679, 1, 'foa-50636', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Birsfelden Bed | FOA7225WH-DR', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/birsfelden-50636.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50636-birsfelden-bed-foa7225wh-dr/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50636-birsfelden-bed-foa7225wh-dr/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50636-birsfelden-bed-foa7225wh-dr/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50636-birsfelden-bed-foa7225wh-dr/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-50636-birsfelden-bed-foa7225wh-dr/5.jpg', 'Just one look, and there is no doubt where this bedroom set belongs--in a modern home. For starters, a striking two-tone design is produced by allowing large blocks of high gloss white to be interrupted by dark, metallic gray gaps. The headboard and case good panels all feature this bold color contrast. True to modern pieces, drawer handles are out of sight, as the gaps serve as concealed pulls as well. Look closer, and you\'ll notice how the gaps themselves are not even in width; this purposeful asymmetry adds more to the appeal and modern vibe.\n• Contemporary\n• White/Metallic Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Asymmetrical Two-tone Design\n• USB Port Behind Night Stand\n• Concealed Drawer Pulls\n• High Gloss Finish w/ Metallic Accents\n• Ball Bearing Glides w/ Felt-lined Top Drawer\n• Drawer Footboard\n• Mattress Ready', 929.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:11:39', '2026-10-07 04:11:39'),
