(685, 1, 'foa-48351', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Chrissy Bed | CM7552BK', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/48351.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48351-chrissy-bed-cm7552bk/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48351-chrissy-bed-cm7552bk/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48351-chrissy-bed-cm7552bk/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48351-chrissy-bed-cm7552bk/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48351-chrissy-bed-cm7552bk/5.jpg', 'Brighten your room with the sheen and shine that this bedroom set delivers. The gleaming finish promotes a refreshing clean aesthetic with silver lines that glisten. Silver tone pulls detail the case goods brilliantly, offering an easy grasp to the one-of-a-kind jewelry drawers. Glimmering and glamorous, create the room you have always dreamed of with this stunning styled bedroom set.\n• Contemporary\n• Black\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Panel Headboard\n• Footboard Drawers\n• Silver Accents\n• Hidden Jewelry Drawers\n• English Dovetail Drawer Construction\n• Mattress Ready', 609.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:12:33', '2026-10-07 04:12:33'),
