(687, 1, 'foa-48383', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Aalok Bed | CM7864', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/48383.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48383-aalok-bed-cm7864/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48383-aalok-bed-cm7864/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48383-aalok-bed-cm7864/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48383-aalok-bed-cm7864/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48383-aalok-bed-cm7864/5.jpg', 'Satisfy your need to shine with this bedroom set from the Aalok Collection. The unique headboard and footboard are upholstered in gray velvet and pleated in a starburst design. The matching pieces are finished in shiny silver, and include modern conveniences like a built-in USB charger. With ample storage and an eye-catching design, this set will make your bedroom a modern sanctuary.\n• Glam\n• Silver, Warm Gray\n• Velvet-like Fabric, Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Padded H/B & F/B w/ Pleated Design\n• Cabriole Legs\n• USB Charger on Night Stand\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer\n• Hidden Drawer in Dresser\n• Foundation Required', 1289.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:12:35', '2026-10-07 04:12:35'),
(688, 1, 'foa-48391', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Eliora Bed | FOA7890', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/48391.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48391-eliora-bed-foa7890/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48391-eliora-bed-foa7890/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48391-eliora-bed-foa7890/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48391-eliora-bed-foa7890/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-48391-eliora-bed-foa7890/5.jpg', 'Glamor and shine have never looked as good as it does with this bedroom set from the Eliora Collection. Everything about this set sparkles. The silvery headboard is padded and button-tufted with crystal acrylic buttons. The matching dresser and night stand include a silver finish and crystal drawer knobs. With ornate accents and curved feet, this chic set will make you feel like royalty.\n• Glam\n• Silver\n• Leatherette, Mirror, Resin, Solid Wood, Others\n• Button Tufted Padded Headboard\n• Crystal-like Acrylic Buttons\n• Mirror Panels\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer & Full-extension Ball Bearing Glides\n• USB Charger on Night Stand\n• Crystal Knobs\n• Foundation Required', 1469.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:12:36', '2026-10-07 04:12:36'),
(689, 1, 'foa-47341', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Conwy Bed | CM7549', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/47341.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-47341-conwy-bed-cm7549/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-47341-conwy-bed-cm7549/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-47341-conwy-bed-cm7549/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-47341-conwy-bed-cm7549/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-47341-conwy-bed-cm7549/5.jpg', 'This bedroom set combines styles seamlessly, thereby creating versatile bedroom decor that fits in nearly any home design. The gray finish is smoky and sophisticated while showcasing a lovely replicated grain along the drawer faces and bed paneling. A tall headboard panel would normally be the highlight of the room but two shelves let you play with votive lighting and accent pieces in a way that can make the bed your own. The accompanying case goods offer clean modern storage for your items.\n• Contemporary\n• Gray\n• Paper Veneer, Others\n• Bookcase Headboard\n• Two-tone Design w/ Black Trim\n• Finger Pull Handles\n• Foundation Required', 629.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:12:38', '2026-10-07 04:12:38'),
