(693, 1, 'foa-39243', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Loraine Bed | CM7195', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/39243.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-39243-loraine-bed-cm7195/1.png', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-39243-loraine-bed-cm7195/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-39243-loraine-bed-cm7195/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-39243-loraine-bed-cm7195/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-39243-loraine-bed-cm7195/5.jpg', 'This is what luxury feels and looks like in the bedroom. The padded leatherette headboard and footboard are beautifully complemented by antique mirror borders, which are also found on the case goods\' front panels. Stylish details like the nailhead trim and button tufting, ring drawer pulls on the case goods drawers, and silver finish all add polish to this sophisticated bedroom set.\n• Glam\n• Champagne\n• Leatherette, Mirror, Resin, Solid Wood, Others\n• Button Tufted Leatherette H/B & F/B\n• Antique Mirror Panels\n• Nailhead Trim\n• Ring Pull Handles\n• English Dovetail Drawer Construction\n• Foundation Required', 1259.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:12', '2026-10-07 04:14:12'),
(694, 1, 'foa-46131', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Calliope Bed | CM7751', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/46131.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46131-calliope-bed-cm7751/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46131-calliope-bed-cm7751/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46131-calliope-bed-cm7751/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46131-calliope-bed-cm7751/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46131-calliope-bed-cm7751/5.jpg', 'This stately bed set features a classic rich espresso finish, ornate metal scrollwork along the mirrored headboard trim and carved wooden details. The deep wooden grain patterns on the headboard and footboard exudes elegance. The case goods have clipped corner and strong trim lines, grounded them in sophisticate appeal. Transform your master bedroom into a luxurious suite.\n• Traditional\n• Espresso\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Faux Wood Carved Details\n• Camelback Design\n• Foundation Required', 1379.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:13', '2026-10-07 04:14:13'),
(695, 1, 'foa-46132', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Calliope Bed | CM7752', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/46132.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46132-calliope-bed-cm7752/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46132-calliope-bed-cm7752/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46132-calliope-bed-cm7752/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46132-calliope-bed-cm7752/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46132-calliope-bed-cm7752/5.jpg', 'This stately bed set features a classic rich espresso finish, ornate metal scroll-work along the mirrored headboard trim and carved wooden details. The deep wooden grain patterns on the headboard and footboard exudes elegance. The case goods have clipped corner and strong trim lines, grounded them in sophisticate appeal. Transform your master bedroom into a luxurious suite.\n• Traditional\n• Espresso\n• Chenille, Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Button Tufted Headboard\n• Faux Wood Carved Details\n• Camelback Design\n• Foundation Required', 1429.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:14', '2026-10-07 04:14:14'),
(696, 1, 'foa-44993', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Argyros Bed | CM7315', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/44993.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-44993-argyros-bed-cm7315/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-44993-argyros-bed-cm7315/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This bedroom set uses V-patterned wood panels to create an elegant display of color and texture.The result is an almost iridescent shine that can give this set a two-toned appearance. A tall headboard design allows for more wood to show off its luscious quality and holds a hidden internal USB charger. The footboard drawers and matching case good faces have the same V-pattern but use a flat strip along with vibrant nickel hardware to separate individual drawers. Simple block feet hold up this sophisticated collection filled with rich wooden hues.\n• Transitional\n• Espresso\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• High Panel Headboard\n• V-Shape Plank Design\n• USB Chargers on both sides of H/B\n• Footboard Drawers\n• Mattress Ready', 1439.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:15', '2026-10-07 04:14:15'),
(697, 1, 'foa-46108', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Brandt Bed | CM7302CH', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/46108.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46108-brandt-bed-cm7302ch/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46108-brandt-bed-cm7302ch/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46108-brandt-bed-cm7302ch/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46108-brandt-bed-cm7302ch/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46108-brandt-bed-cm7302ch/5.jpg', 'This bedroom set offers two solutions at once. It is visually stunning, and has unrivaled storage space to keep your fabulous new room clutter free. This bed\'s main attraction is not the solid panel curving headboard but the pairs of drawers integrated into the footboard and side railing. The brown cherry finish and antique hardware of this piece gives it a subtle elegance.\n• Transitional\n• Brown Cherry\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Storage Bed\n• Wood Inlay Design\n• Rail Drawers on Both Sides & Footboard Drawers\n• Felt-lined Top Drawers\n• Insect Deterring Cedar Drawer & English Dovetail Construction\n• USB/Power Outlet & Lighting in Night Stand\n• Mattress Ready', 1559.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:16', '2026-10-07 04:14:16'),
(698, 1, 'foa-46116', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Brandt Bed | CM7302GY', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/46116.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46116-brandt-bed-cm7302gy/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46116-brandt-bed-cm7302gy/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46116-brandt-bed-cm7302gy/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46116-brandt-bed-cm7302gy/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46116-brandt-bed-cm7302gy/5.jpg', 'This bedroom set offers two solutions at once. It is visually stunning, and has unrivaled storage space to keep your fabulous new room clutter free. This bed\'s main attraction is not the solid panel curving headboard but the pairs of drawers integrated into the footboard and side railing. The gray finish and antique hardware of this piece gives it a subtle elegance.\n• Transitional\n• Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Storage Bed\n• Wood Inlay Design\n• Rail Drawers on Both Sides & Footboard Drawers\n• Felt-lined Top Drawers\n• Insect Deterring Cedar Drawer & English Dovetail Construction\n• USB/Power Outlet & Lighting in Night Stand\n• Mattress Ready', 1559.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:47', '2026-10-07 04:14:47'),
(699, 1, 'foa-46130', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Menodora Bed | CM7311', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/46130.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46130-menodora-bed-cm7311/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46130-menodora-bed-cm7311/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46130-menodora-bed-cm7311/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46130-menodora-bed-cm7311/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-46130-menodora-bed-cm7311/5.jpg', 'The elegant curves of this bedroom set create a stunning, and graceful bedroom environment. The sleigh bed provides a chic silhouette with its curving frame. The espresso finished wood has been carved with a winding rope-like trim that has been brushed with gold to match the lavish drawer hardware and ornaments. The rounded bun feet finish off the ensemble to give this set a dignified air.\n• Transitional\n• Brown Cherry\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Camelback Headboard Design\n• Ornate Detailing\n• Genuine Marble Top on Nightstand & Dresser\n• Antique Inspired Drawer Pulls\n• Felt-lined Top Drawers\n• Foundation Required', 1799.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:48', '2026-10-07 04:14:48'),
(700, 1, 'foa-43646', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Bianca Bed | CM7734', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/43646.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43646-bianca-bed-cm7734/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43646-bianca-bed-cm7734/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43646-bianca-bed-cm7734/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43646-bianca-bed-cm7734/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43646-bianca-bed-cm7734/5.jpg', 'This rustic style bedroom set takes the best of all interior designs by blending the classics with rugged rustic flair. Each piece is scaled to balance the rural details with a minimalistic approach that exemplifies down to earth sophistication. The solid wood pieces are topped with wood veneer, giving each piece a smooth and refined exterior. Felt-lined top drawers and sliding cabinet doors give the storage pieces extra appeal.\n• Rustic\n• Dark Walnut\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Plank Style Headboard & Footboard\n• Sliding Cabinet Doors on Dresser\n• Felt-lined Top Drawers\n• Ball Bearing Metal Glides\n• Foundation Required', 1079.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:49', '2026-10-07 04:14:49'),
(701, 1, 'foa-43758', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Christie Bed | CM7550', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/43758.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43758-christie-bed-cm7550/1.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'If you are a fan of sleek minimalism this bedroom set will give you exactly what you want. A low profile platform design keeps the bed floating just above the ground. The design is the only embellishment necessary, its form and function flawlessly entwined. The night stands are low lying and flush with the bed platform so it feels uniform and balanced. The dresser and chest add a touch of chrome to the high gloss finishes to break up the shapes without compromising on modern sensibilities.\n• Contemporary\n• White\n• Leatherette, Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Low Profile Bed\n• Padded Headboard\n• Felt-lined Top Drawers\n• English Dovetail Drawer Construction\n• High Gloss Lacquer Coating\n• USB Charger in Night Stand\n• Slat Kit Included', 1079.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:50', '2026-10-07 04:14:50'),
(702, 1, 'foa-43767', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Chrissy Bed | CM7552', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/43767.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43767-chrissy-bed-cm7552/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43767-chrissy-bed-cm7552/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43767-chrissy-bed-cm7552/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43767-chrissy-bed-cm7552/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43767-chrissy-bed-cm7552/5.jpg', 'Brighten your room with the sheen and shine that this bedroom set delivers. The gleaming white finishes promote a refreshingly clean aesthetic with silver lines that glisten in any light. Silver tone pulls detail the case goods brilliantly, offering an easy grasp to the one-of-a-kind jewelry drawers. Store fresh bedding in the spacious footboard drawer and conveniently store essentials next to your bedside with the stylish nightstand. Glimmering and glamorous, create the room you have always dreamed of with this stunning styled bedroom set.\n• Contemporary\n• White\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Panel Headboard\n• Footboard Drawers\n• Silver Accents\n• Hidden Jewelry Drawers\n• English Dovetail Drawer Construction\n• Mattress Ready', 629.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:51', '2026-10-07 04:14:51'),
(703, 1, 'foa-43838', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Brachium Bed | CM7977SV', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/43838.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43838-brachium-bed-cm7977sv/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43838-brachium-bed-cm7977sv/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43838-brachium-bed-cm7977sv/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43838-brachium-bed-cm7977sv/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43838-brachium-bed-cm7977sv/5.jpg', 'Get the most out of your bedroom with this contemporary style bedroom set. The button tufted leatherette headboard offers unlimited comfort so you can lean into it in any angle. The LED light trim on the headboard adds a tasteful sense of convenience for your nightly reading materials. The decorative mirror accents and ornate bun feet compliment these stylish features and the felt-lined top drawers blend traditional elements well.\n• Contemporary\n• Silver\n• Mirror, Leatherette, Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Button Tufted Headboard\n• LED Light Trim on Headboard & Mirror\n• Crocodile-Textured Detail\n• Felt-lined Top Drawers\n• Mirror Trim\n• Foundation Required', 959.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:53', '2026-10-07 04:14:53'),
(704, 1, 'foa-43872', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Atria Bed | CM7687BG', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/43872.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43872-atria-bed-cm7687bg/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43872-atria-bed-cm7687bg/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43872-atria-bed-cm7687bg/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43872-atria-bed-cm7687bg/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43872-atria-bed-cm7687bg/5.jpg', 'Bring a modern and up-to-date vibe to your bedroom setting with the sophisticated design of this contemporary bed. The sleek flannelette upholstery adds a soft cushion to the tall headboard and footboard, which feature a uniquely tiered silhouette to enhance the visual appeal. Sophisticated vertical tufts line the length of the upholstery to create a ridged look sure to match any aesthetic.\n• Contemporary Style\n• Padded Flannelette Fabric\n• Nailhead Trim\n• Corner Cut-out Design\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer & Others*\n• Available in 2 Colors', 659.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:53', '2026-10-07 04:14:53'),
(705, 1, 'foa-43919', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Mirabelle Bed | CM7679GY', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/43919.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43919-mirabelle-bed-cm7679gy/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43919-mirabelle-bed-cm7679gy/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43919-mirabelle-bed-cm7679gy/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43919-mirabelle-bed-cm7679gy/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-43919-mirabelle-bed-cm7679gy/5.jpg', 'With each detail carefully crafted, the outcome is this beautifully designed bed! Shiny nailhead trim perfectly lines the wingback panel headboard, which also features deep button tufting for added depth and design.\n• Transitional\n• Gray\n• Velvet-like Fabric, Solid Wood, Others\n• Wingback Headboard\n• Padded Flannelette\n• Button Tufted Headboard w/ Nailhead Trim\n• Foundation Required', 1559.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:14:54', '2026-10-07 04:14:54'),
(706, 1, 'foa-41992', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Lysandra Bed | CM7663', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/41992.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-41992-lysandra-bed-cm7663/1.png', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-41992-lysandra-bed-cm7663/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-41992-lysandra-bed-cm7663/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-41992-lysandra-bed-cm7663/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-41992-lysandra-bed-cm7663/5.jpg', 'Luxury and style blends together to make this beautiful contemporary sleigh bedroom set. The fabric padded headboard and footboard provide warm comfort and paired button tufted details offer an extravagant finish. Case goods feature antique handles and the rustic natural wood finish creates a soothing bedroom environment. Make your sleeping area feel like a luxurious getaway with this extraordinary bedroom set!\n• Transitional\n• Rustic Natural Tone, Beige\n• Linen-like Fabric, Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Sleigh Bed\n• Button Tufted Headboard & Footboard\n• Antique Drawer Pulls\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer\n• Fluted Corners\n• Foundation Required', 2309.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:16:28', '2026-10-07 04:16:28'),
(707, 1, 'foa-42081', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Bed', 'Lennart Bed | CM7386WH', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/bed/42081.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-42081-lennart-bed-cm7386wh/1.png', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-42081-lennart-bed-cm7386wh/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-42081-lennart-bed-cm7386wh/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-42081-lennart-bed-cm7386wh/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bed/foa-42081-lennart-bed-cm7386wh/5.jpg', 'For a quick modern update to your home, this collection will add that trendy mid-century appeal. Featuring a sleek white finish and wooden headboard, this panel bed is complete in a platform style with an included mattress ready slat kit. Coordinating case goods boast slim flared legs and recessed handle drawer pulls. A choice of oval or rectangular wall mountable mirror completes this set.\n• Mid-Century Modern\n• White\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Round Tapered Legs\n• Recessed Drawer Handles\n• Optional Stand-alone Oval Mirror\n• Slat Kit Included', 659.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:16:30', '2026-10-07 04:16:30'),
