(936, 1, 'foa-45183', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Bunk Bed', 'Opal Twin/Full Bunk Bed | CM-BK931RD-TF', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/bunk-bed/opal-45183.html', 'Images/foagroup/Bunk Bed/foa-45183-opal-twinfull-bunk-bed-cm-bk931rd-tf/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bunk Bed/foa-45183-opal-twinfull-bunk-bed-cm-bk931rd-tf/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bunk Bed/foa-45183-opal-twinfull-bunk-bed-cm-bk931rd-tf/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bunk Bed/foa-45183-opal-twinfull-bunk-bed-cm-bk931rd-tf/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Bunk Bed/foa-45183-opal-twinfull-bunk-bed-cm-bk931rd-tf/5.jpg', 'You can\'t go wrong with a classic. Bunk bed designs don\'t get more straightforward than this but with simplicity there is flexibility. Whether it\'s matching color options or sizes, this bunk bed fills your needs. Rest easy knowing you purchased a top of line safety product. The robust full metal construction features our state-of-the-art Embedded Bracket Joint Structure giving unprecedented strength and stability to the bed platforms. Each rail is inserted into the rig and bolted, leaving no room to bend or rattle.\n• Contemporary\n• Red\n• Metal\n• Full Metal Construction\n• Improved Rail Reinforcement\n• Top Guard Rails\n• Attached Ladder\n• Bracket Joint Structure\n• Slat Kit Included', 529.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:01:49', '2026-10-07 05:01:49'),
