(1278, 1, 'foa-51893', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Catalog', NULL, 'Cochrane Loveseat | SM5120-LV', 'https://www.foagroup.com/cochrane-51893.html', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-51893-cochrane-loveseat-sm5120-lv/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-51893-cochrane-loveseat-sm5120-lv/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-51893-cochrane-loveseat-sm5120-lv/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-51893-cochrane-loveseat-sm5120-lv/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-51893-cochrane-loveseat-sm5120-lv/5.jpg', 'Upholstered in a fuzzy-than-ordinary chenille fabric and accented by a variety of beige highlights, this set exudes an aura of warmth and welcome. Chic and brimming in softness, the texture complements the slightly rounded silhouette of each piece perfectly. Lounge on the wide, firm seat cushions or lean your head over the low, padded structured track arms. Accent pillows and the matching ottoman feature a distinct line pattern that give them enough contemporary appeal.\n• Contemporary\n• Cream/Beige\n• Chenille, Solid Wood\n• Box Seat Cushion\n• Loose Pillow Back\n• Track Arms\n• Accent Pillows Included\n• Matching Swivel Chair', 1539.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 07:10:13', '2026-10-07 07:10:13'),
(1279, 1, 'foa-47583', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Catalog', NULL, 'Nefyn Sofa | SM2670-SF', 'https://www.foagroup.com/nefyn-47583.html', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-47583-nefyn-sofa-sm2670-sf/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-47583-nefyn-sofa-sm2670-sf/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-47583-nefyn-sofa-sm2670-sf/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-47583-nefyn-sofa-sm2670-sf/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-47583-nefyn-sofa-sm2670-sf/5.jpg', 'Create a lounge area where you can enjoy a small chat and a cup of coffee. This sofa set maintains a high level of comfort while delivering a pleasing visual. Sloped arms give this set a silhouette that can help define your lounge space. The addition of a textured throw blanket will help this set stand out and give you something cozy to add to the room. A beautiful set for establishing a tranquil mood.\n• Transitional\n• Gray\n• Burlap Weave, Solid Wood, Others\n• Medium Density Foam\n• Sloped Arms\n• Single Cushion Seat\n• Tapered Block Legs\n• Pillows Included', 2399.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 07:10:15', '2026-10-07 07:10:15'),
