(1290, 1, 'foa-41999', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Catalog', NULL, 'Ganymede Mirror | CM7855M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/ganymede-41999.html', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-41999-ganymede-mirror-cm7855m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-41999-ganymede-mirror-cm7855m/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-41999-ganymede-mirror-cm7855m/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-41999-ganymede-mirror-cm7855m/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-41999-ganymede-mirror-cm7855m/5.jpg', 'When you think of country farmhouse this lovely bedroom collection comes to mind. The soothing gray finish has a rustic, weathered look that goes beautifully with the vertical panel detailing.\n• Transitional Style\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others*\n• Gray Finish', 209.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-09 00:57:15', '2026-10-09 00:57:15'),
(1291, 1, 'foa-49091', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Catalog', NULL, 'Roanne Bed | FOA7927', 'https://www.foagroup.com/49091.html', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-49091-roanne-bed-foa7927/1.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-49091-roanne-bed-foa7927/4.jpg', NULL, 'The perfect juvenile-sized bed for the young person with maturing tastes. With a button-tufted padded headboard, gray wood grain finish, and an optional trundle for the bed, this represents a new standard for the youth segment. Your kids will appreciate just how well this bed accommodates them.\n• Cottage\n• Gray, Charcoal\n• Fabric, Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Button-Tufted\n• Padded Headboard\n• Optional Trundle\n• Black Rectangular Pulls\n• Foundation Required', 359.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-09 06:54:18', '2026-10-09 06:54:18'),
(1292, 1, 'foa-50829', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Catalog', NULL, 'Delphinium Mattress | DM269', 'https://www.foagroup.com/delphinium-50829.html', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-50829-delphinium-mattress-dm269/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-50829-delphinium-mattress-dm269/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-50829-delphinium-mattress-dm269/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-50829-delphinium-mattress-dm269/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-50829-delphinium-mattress-dm269/5.jpg', 'This North American-made mattress is designed with multi-layer foam construction and topped with a proprietary cooling cover for maximum comfort. Its gel-infused air memory foam helps contour to the shape of the body.\n• Quilting: Cooling White Knit Fabric + Side Panel\n• Safety: 16 CFR Part 1633 Flammability Standard Approved\n• Fabric: TENCEL and Polyester\n• Foam: Gel Infused Air Memory Foam, Convoluted Foam, Support Base Foam\n• Comfort: Medium Firm\n• Packaging: Roll-in Box', 859.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-09 06:54:19', '2026-10-09 06:54:19'),
(1293, 1, 'foa-57289', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Catalog', NULL, 'Tresa Dining Arm Chair w/ Casters | FM-AC3002KPYL', 'https://www.foagroup.com/tresa-57289.html', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-57289-tresa-dining-arm-chair-w-casters-fm-ac3002kpyl/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-57289-tresa-dining-arm-chair-w-casters-fm-ac3002kpyl/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-57289-tresa-dining-arm-chair-w-casters-fm-ac3002kpyl/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-57289-tresa-dining-arm-chair-w-casters-fm-ac3002kpyl/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-57289-tresa-dining-arm-chair-w-casters-fm-ac3002kpyl/5.jpg', 'An artful silhouette gives the Tresa dining arm chair w/ casters in Masked Weaver Yellow a memorable presence around the table. The fabric surface adds tactile warmth and an inviting finish. Plush rounded seat, sculpted pedestal-style base with casters makes repositioning easier. Full upholstery creates a seamless, tailored look.\n• Contemporary\n• Masked Weaver Yellow\n• Fabric, Foam, Solid Wood, Engineered Wood\n• Barrel-Back Design With Dramatic Wraparound\n• Fully Upholstered Silhouette\n• Soft Neutral Textured Fabric\n• Integrated Cutout Along The Back For Visual Lightness\n• Plush Rounded Seat\n• Sculpted Pedestal-Style Base\n• Casters', 419.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-09 06:54:21', '2026-10-09 06:54:21'),
(1294, 1, 'foa-48803', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Catalog', NULL, 'Santiago Love Seat | CM6077BR-LV', 'https://www.foagroup.com/santiago-48803.html', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-48803-santiago-love-seat-cm6077br-lv/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-48803-santiago-love-seat-cm6077br-lv/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-48803-santiago-love-seat-cm6077br-lv/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-48803-santiago-love-seat-cm6077br-lv/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-48803-santiago-love-seat-cm6077br-lv/5.jpg', 'A unique alternative to the love seat, the Santiago Collection delivers comfort with handsome style. A rustic weathered oak finish defines the arms, seat, and seat back, while upholstered cushions add softness with the perfect level of support. Combine multiple pieces to create the perfect set for your living room or den.\n• Rustic\n• Ash Brown\n• Leatherette, Metal, Solid Wood, Others, Fabric\n• Wooden Frame\n• Metal Legs', 1249.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-09 06:54:22', '2026-10-09 06:54:22'),
(1295, 1, 'foa-50792', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Catalog', NULL, 'Sybella Bed | CM7218GY', 'https://www.foagroup.com/sybella-50792.html', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-50792-sybella-bed-cm7218gy/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-50792-sybella-bed-cm7218gy/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-50792-sybella-bed-cm7218gy/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-50792-sybella-bed-cm7218gy/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-50792-sybella-bed-cm7218gy/5.jpg', 'Comfort and functionality are the hallmarks of this fully upholstered, mattress-ready bed. On the comfort side, there\'s the rich linen-like fabric that wraps around the frame of the bed, culminating in a simple rectangular headboard with beautiful diamond tufting. Functionality-wise, the foot end of the bed is a smooth rolling drawer with casters; it\'s the perfect storage spot for any extra pillows or beddings within arm\'s reach.\n• Transitional\n• Gray\n• Linen-like, Others\n• Fully Upholstered Frame\n• Button Tufted Headboard\n• Mattress Ready\n• Underbed Storage Drawer with Casters', 599.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-09 06:54:23', '2026-10-09 06:54:23'),
(1296, 1, 'foa-57028', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Catalog', NULL, 'Avara Sofa + Loveseat | FM67015SKBR-2PC', 'https://www.foagroup.com/avara-57028.html', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-57028-avara-sofa-loveseat-fm67015skbr-2pc/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-57028-avara-sofa-loveseat-fm67015skbr-2pc/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-57028-avara-sofa-loveseat-fm67015skbr-2pc/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-57028-avara-sofa-loveseat-fm67015skbr-2pc/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-57028-avara-sofa-loveseat-fm67015skbr-2pc/5.jpg', 'Designed around the way you truly live, the Avara sofa + loveseat in Warm Mink Brown makes everyday lounging feel more special. The fabric surface adds tactile warmth and an inviting finish. Tufted tuxedo track arm adds tailored depth and texture. Tight back with diamond button-tufting adds tailored depth and texture.\n• Contemporary\n• Warm Mink Brown\n• Engineered Wood, Solid Wood, Sinuous Spring, Webbing,Foam, Fabric\n• Plush Velvet\n• Tufted Tuxedo Track Arm\n• Tight Back With Diamond Button-Tufting\n• 1.75lb High Density Foam', 2999.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-09 06:54:24', '2026-10-09 06:54:24'),
(1297, 1, 'foa-47575', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Catalog', NULL, 'Sisseton Sofa | SM2208-SF', 'https://www.foagroup.com/sisseton-47575.html', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-47575-sisseton-sofa-sm2208-sf/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-47575-sisseton-sofa-sm2208-sf/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-47575-sisseton-sofa-sm2208-sf/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-47575-sisseton-sofa-sm2208-sf/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-47575-sisseton-sofa-sm2208-sf/5.jpg', 'Low arms that sweep up to the back and a dainty nailhead trim dotting around the feet give this sofa collection its stunning looks. The throw pillows feature a variety of designs that pop and give a stunning counter to the solid upholstery of the pieces. Comforting foam fills the plump box cushion seating and loose back pillows for an ultra comforting seat.\n• Transitional\n• Purple\n• Chenille, Solid Wood, Others\n• Medium Density Foam\n• Sloped Arms\n• T-Cushion Seats\n• Nailhead trim\n• Loose Back Pillows\n• Cabriole Feet\n• Pillows Included', 2399.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-09 06:54:26', '2026-10-09 06:54:26'),
(1298, 1, 'foa-41235', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Catalog', NULL, 'Rexburg Bed | CM7382', 'https://www.foagroup.com/41235.html', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-41235-rexburg-bed-cm7382/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-41235-rexburg-bed-cm7382/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-41235-rexburg-bed-cm7382/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-41235-rexburg-bed-cm7382/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Catalog/foa-41235-rexburg-bed-cm7382/5.jpg', 'Style your bedroom in a look you\n• Rustic\n• Wire-Brushed Rustic Brown\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Panel Headboard\n• Metal Bar Handles\n• Foundation Required', 479.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-09 06:54:27', '2026-10-09 06:54:27');
