(1036, 1, 'foa-51242', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Chest', 'Zohar Chest | CM7130PK-C', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/chest/zohar-51242.html', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-51242-zohar-chest-cm7130pk-c/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-51242-zohar-chest-cm7130pk-c/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-51242-zohar-chest-cm7130pk-c/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-51242-zohar-chest-cm7130pk-c/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-51242-zohar-chest-cm7130pk-c/5.jpg', 'Showcase your personal taste with this bold statement piece in your bedroom. Fully upholstered in flannelette, this chest features eye-catching tufting. The padded fabric and crystal buttons continue all throughout the drawers. Each drawer handle is made of glistening acrylic crystals, while silver-painted cabriole legs are perfect in bringing in majestic vibes.\n• Glam\n• Pink\n• Velvet-like, Solid Wood, Others\n• Fully Upholstered\n• Crystal-Like Acrylic Buttons\n• Cabriole Legs', 719.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:26:47', '2026-10-07 05:26:47'),
(1037, 1, 'foa-50554', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Chest', 'Myrtlemoore Chest | EM7079IV-C', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/chest/myrtlemoore-50554.html', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-50554-myrtlemoore-chest-em7079iv-c/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-50554-myrtlemoore-chest-em7079iv-c/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-50554-myrtlemoore-chest-em7079iv-c/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-50554-myrtlemoore-chest-em7079iv-c/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-50554-myrtlemoore-chest-em7079iv-c/5.jpg', 'This lighter tone chest will be a great addition to any farmhouse space. Between the light vintage ivory frames to the contrasting rustic gray crown moldings, it exudes irresistible charm. And then there\'s the attention to detail: it is meticulously hand-painted and hand-finished for that exotic distressed look. So much has gone into the construction as well; each drawer feature English dovetails and ball-bearing metal side glides for maximum weight capacity. Finally, the chest is made of sustainably sourced pine wood.\n• Rustic\n• Vintage Ivory/Rustic Gray\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• FSC Certified Solid Wood Brazilian Pine\n• Carved Wooden Floral Accents\n• Hand-painted with Non-toxic Water-Based Paint\n• English Dovetail Drawers with Ball-bearing Metal Side Glides\n• Distressed Finish & Finished Backside', 1359.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:26:49', '2026-10-07 05:26:49'),
(1038, 1, 'foa-49593', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Chest', 'Vevey Chest | FOA7175C', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/chest/vevey-49593.html', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-49593-vevey-chest-foa7175c/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-49593-vevey-chest-foa7175c/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Chest/foa-49593-vevey-chest-foa7175c/3.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'For the young person with burgeoning style, here is a refined chest befit of maturing taste. A rich wood grain texture highlights the construction. No frills molding and spacious drawers speak to a greater efficiency. Black metal pulls are attached firmly for easy operation, the primary drawer complimented with felt lining. An attractive and sturdy piece, it\'s the ideal addition to accommodate necessity and style.\n• Transitional\n• Wire-Brushed Warm Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer\n• Round Pull Knobs\n• Wood Grain Texture', 659.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:26:50', '2026-10-07 05:26:50'),
