(299, 1, 'foa-51715', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Manzanillo Dresser | CM7470BL-D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/manzanillo-51715.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51715-manzanillo-dresser-cm7470bl-d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51715-manzanillo-dresser-cm7470bl-d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51715-manzanillo-dresser-cm7470bl-d/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51715-manzanillo-dresser-cm7470bl-d/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51715-manzanillo-dresser-cm7470bl-d/5.jpg', 'Gorgeous lines and a grand silhouette give this bedroom furniture a distinctive edge. The nickel hardware which comes in knobs and cup pulls adds a slight sense of fancy. Molding details on each case good\'s front give it a country twist that\'s amplified by the bold slate blue finish.\n• Transitional\n• Slate Blue\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Ball-bearing Glides for Case Good Drawers\n• Nickel Round Knobs and Cup Pulls', 1119.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:25:44', '2026-10-07 02:25:44'),
(300, 1, 'foa-51739', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Vagan Dresser | CM7472GY-D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/vagan-51739.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51739-vagan-dresser-cm7472gy-d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51739-vagan-dresser-cm7472gy-d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51739-vagan-dresser-cm7472gy-d/3.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'The diagonal replicated grain meet at the center line, forming a V-shaped pattern found on the front panels. Contemporary elements continue throughout this ensemble, with the black angled legs and sleek finger pulls found on the matching case goods. Coordinating pieces like this set offer a stress-free experience in updating your bedroom decor.\n• Contemporary\n• Gray\n• Solid Wood, Paper Veneer, Others\n• Chevron Pattern\n• Replicated Wood Grain\n• Black Angled Wooden Legs\n• Black Finger Pulls', 729.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:25:58', '2026-10-07 02:25:58'),
(301, 1, 'foa-51747', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Esparanza Dresser | CM7478CH-D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/esparanza-51747.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51747-esparanza-dresser-cm7478ch-d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51747-esparanza-dresser-cm7478ch-d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51747-esparanza-dresser-cm7478ch-d/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51747-esparanza-dresser-cm7478ch-d/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51747-esparanza-dresser-cm7478ch-d/5.jpg', 'If luxury is a necessity for the bedroom, then this bedroom set is a must-have. The case goods are a wonder as well--both nightstand and dresser share genuine marble tops, beautiful and unique for each piece. All drawers are dovetail construction--the top drawer feature felt-lining, middle drawer are birch, and bottom drawers made of cedar wood, a natural insect repellant. With all its lavish offerings, to say this traditional set is over-the-top would be a gross understatement.\n• Traditional\n• Brown Cherry\n• Leatherette, Marble, Polyresin, Solid Wood, Others\n• Faux Wood Carved Details\n• Genuine Marble Top on Dresser\n• Felt-lined Top\n• Birch Middle\n• and Cedar Bottom Drawers\n• Ball-bearing Glides\n• Dovetail Drawers', 1799.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:26:09', '2026-10-07 02:26:09'),
