(303, 1, 'foa-51763', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Dortmund Dresser | CM7465WH-D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/dortmund-51763.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51763-dortmund-dresser-cm7465wh-d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51763-dortmund-dresser-cm7465wh-d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-51763-dortmund-dresser-cm7465wh-d/3.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'This modern bedroom group sets itself apart through simple design with a few delightful twists. It starts with the clean white finish--a classic element that thrives when paired with subtle yet impactful details. Look closely and you\'ll notice the wave texture found on the front panels of each of the matching case goods, beautifully framed by moldings with mitered angles. Finally, angled legs and gorgeous lines add contemporary flair to this ensemble\'s sleek silhouette.\n• Contemporary\n• White\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Mitered Corner Design\n• Wave Texture\n• Angled Legs\n• Bronze Round Knobs', 779.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:26:31', '2026-10-07 02:26:31'),
