(317, 1, 'foa-50590', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Woodburn Mirror | EM7071BR-M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/woodburn-50590.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50590-woodburn-mirror-em7071br-m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50590-woodburn-mirror-em7071br-m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'At first sight, it is hard to deny the meticulous level of details that went into creating this masterpiece. From the hand-painted ash brown wood to the hand-distressed finish, this solid wood mirror--made from responsibly-harvested Brazilian pine--is the perfect centerpiece for a farmhouse-inspired setting.\n• Rustic\n• Ash Brown\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• FSC Certified Solid Wood Brazilian Pine\n• Farmhouse Design\n• Distressed Finish\n• Hand-painted with Non-toxic Water-Based Paint', 429.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:28:20', '2026-10-07 02:28:20'),
(318, 1, 'foa-50605', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Emmeline Dresser | FOA7147WH-D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/emmeline-50605.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50605-emmeline-dresser-foa7147wh-d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50605-emmeline-dresser-foa7147wh-d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50605-emmeline-dresser-foa7147wh-d/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50605-emmeline-dresser-foa7147wh-d/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50605-emmeline-dresser-foa7147wh-d/5.jpg', 'The enticing combination of glamour and Art Deco has long been attempted, but rarely with such successful results as achieved with this dresser. It is a visual masterpiece, harkening to the days of Old Hollywood while establishing a rich, dynamic concept for the bedroom. The jewel-carved faux glass feet support the components with regal authority. Classic embossed patterns tie the set together in one magnificent and highly desirable theme.\n• Contemporary\n• White\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Embossed Art Deco Pattern\n• Hiddden Jewelry Drawers\n• Acrylic legs', 1429.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:28:33', '2026-10-07 02:28:33'),
(319, 1, 'foa-50630', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Birsfelden Dresser | FOA7225WH-D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/birsfelden-50630.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50630-birsfelden-dresser-foa7225wh-d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50630-birsfelden-dresser-foa7225wh-d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50630-birsfelden-dresser-foa7225wh-d/3.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'Just one look, and there is no doubt where this dresser belongs--in a modern home. For starters, a striking two-tone design is produced by allowing large blocks of high gloss white to be interrupted by dark, metallic gray gaps. The panels all feature this bold color contrast. True to modern pieces, drawer handles are out of sight, as the gaps serve as concealed pulls as well. Look closer, and you\'ll notice how the gaps themselves are not even in width; this purposeful asymmetry adds more to the appeal and modern vibe.\n• Contemporary\n• White/Metallic Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Asymmetrical Two-tone Design\n• Concealed Drawer Pulls\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer\n• Ball Bearing Glides\n• High Gloss Finish w/ Metallic Accents', 979.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:28:41', '2026-10-07 02:28:41'),
(320, 1, 'foa-50662', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Syracuse Dresser | CM7129GY-D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/syracuse-50662.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50662-syracuse-dresser-cm7129gy-d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50662-syracuse-dresser-cm7129gy-d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50662-syracuse-dresser-cm7129gy-d/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50662-syracuse-dresser-cm7129gy-d/4.jpg', NULL, 'Take your bedroom set to the next level. These beautifully decorated case goods are finished in a stunning gray finish. Antique brass handles with acrylic accents complete the overall luxurious look and feel.\n• Traditional\n• Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Ball Bearing Metal Glides\n• Antique Brass Handles w/ Acrylic Accent\n• English Dovetail Drawer Construction', 1009.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:28:50', '2026-10-07 02:28:50'),
(321, 1, 'foa-50278', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Timandra Dresser | CM7145D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/timandra-50278.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50278-timandra-dresser-cm7145d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50278-timandra-dresser-cm7145d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50278-timandra-dresser-cm7145d/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50278-timandra-dresser-cm7145d/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50278-timandra-dresser-cm7145d/5.jpg', 'There\'s something magnificent about home decor with transitional styling; this dresser is a perfect example. The floral and rope faux wood details are borrowed elements from traditional pieces, while the rustic natural tone finish brings warmth to any room. Bring in cold, modern elements such as reflective mirror panels for an updated look. Either way you look at it, this piece is bound to be an instant classic.\n• Transitional\n• Rustic Natural Tone\n• Mirror, Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Faux Wood Carved Details\n• Mirror Inserts on Drawers\n• Bronze Round Knobs & Hanging Pulls\n• Full-extension Ball Bearing Glides', 1259.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:29:00', '2026-10-07 02:29:00'),
(322, 1, 'foa-50280', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Timandra Mirror | CM7145M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/timandra-50280.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50280-timandra-mirror-cm7145m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50280-timandra-mirror-cm7145m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'There\'s something magnificent about home decor with transitional styling; this mirror is a perfect example. The floral and rope faux wood details are borrowed elements from traditional pieces, while the rustic natural tone finish brings warmth to any room.\n• Transitional\n• Rustic Natural Tone\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Faux Wood Carved Details\n• Arched Top Design', 419.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:29:07', '2026-10-07 02:29:07'),
(323, 1, 'foa-50306', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Agathon Dresser | CM7182D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/agathon-50306.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50306-agathon-dresser-cm7182d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50306-agathon-dresser-cm7182d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50306-agathon-dresser-cm7182d/3.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'This bedroom set will fit in well in a Mediterranean-inspired space. This dresser features fluted panels and columns topped with foliage details reminiscent of classical architecture. The color palette hints at history as well--the antique white finish partnered with the gray top pieces lends a unique kind of worn-out charm. Simple horizontal dark bronze hardware on the case goods completes this fine-looking ensemble.\n• Transitional\n• Antique White/Gray\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Two-tone\n• Foliage Details\n• Fluted Panels\n• Dark Bronze Bar Pull\n• Felt-lined Top Drawers\n• English Dovetail', 779.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:29:14', '2026-10-07 02:29:14'),
(324, 1, 'foa-50308', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Agathon Mirror | CM7182M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/agathon-50308.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50308-agathon-mirror-cm7182m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50308-agathon-mirror-cm7182m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This bedroom set will fit in well in a Mediterranean-inspired space. The mirror features fluted panels and columns topped with foliage details reminiscent of classical architecture. The color palette hints at history as well--the antique white finish partnered with the gray top pieces lends a unique kind of worn-out charm.\n• Transitional\n• Antique White/Gray\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Two-tone\n• Foliage Details\n• Fluted Panels', 179.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:29:19', '2026-10-07 02:29:19'),
(325, 1, 'foa-50325', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Georgette Mirror | CM7184M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/georgette-50325.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50325-georgette-mirror-cm7184m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50325-georgette-mirror-cm7184m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The curved, bell-shaped design is the highlight of this mirror. Along with the intricate faux wood detail on its top, it connects visually to the rest of the set entirely finished in bright antique white.\n• Transitional\n• Antique White\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Bell-shaped Design', 239.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:29:26', '2026-10-07 02:29:26'),
(326, 1, 'foa-50332', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Fortworth Dresser | CM7186D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/fortworth-50332.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50332-fortworth-dresser-cm7186d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50332-fortworth-dresser-cm7186d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50332-fortworth-dresser-cm7186d/3.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'A tasteful combination of classic details with a pinch of rustic influence, this dresser is a masterpiece in its own right. Every top and bottom edge is trimmed with beautiful molding details, adding visual heft to this bold piece. Complementing the molding nicely are the massive bracket legs. The gray finish and replicated wood grain brings the barnyard appeal, further enhanced by the black metal hardware on each drawer.\n• Transitional\n• Gray\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Replicated Wood Grain\n• Bracket Legs\n• Edge Trim Molding\n• Black Bar Pulls\n• English Dovetails', 629.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:29:35', '2026-10-07 02:29:35'),
(327, 1, 'foa-50334', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Fortworth Mirror | CM7186M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/fortworth-50334.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50334-fortworth-mirror-cm7186m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50334-fortworth-mirror-cm7186m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A tasteful combination of classic details with a pinch of rustic influence, this mirror is a masterpiece in its own right. Every top and bottom edge is trimmed with beautiful molding details, adding visual heft to this bold piece. The gray finish and replicated wood grain brings the barnyard appeal, further enhanced by the simple, rectangular silhouette.\n• Transitional\n• Gray\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Replicated Wood Grain', 179.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:29:41', '2026-10-07 02:29:41'),
(328, 1, 'foa-50368', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Louis Philippe Mirror | CM7966BK-M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/louis-philippe-50368.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50368-louis-philippe-mirror-cm7966bk-m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50368-louis-philippe-mirror-cm7966bk-m/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50368-louis-philippe-mirror-cm7966bk-m/3.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'Style your master bedroom however you like with this classic collection, featuring multi-storage case goods, all with an identical color finish. The mirror is a simple design with straight edges and angled corners. Bring a unique taste to your bedroom while creating a relaxing and stylish environment.\n• Transitional\n• Black\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others', 89.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:29:49', '2026-10-07 02:29:49'),
(329, 1, 'foa-50397', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Bellinzona Mirror | CM7992M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/bellinzona-50397.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50397-bellinzona-mirror-cm7992m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50397-bellinzona-mirror-cm7992m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Add a modern touch to your bedroom with this glitzy ensemble. This mirror doubles as a vanity with its embedded LED lights, while its edges are trimmed with mirror accents. The interplay of the emitted glow and the reflective surfaces makes the case for a luxurious and luminous space.\n• Contemporary\n• Silver\n• Mirror, Solid Wood, Others\n• Embedded LED Light\n• Mirror Trim Accents', 359.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:29:55', '2026-10-07 02:29:55'),
(330, 1, 'foa-50437', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Blanchefleur Mirror | FOA51007', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/blanchefleur-50437.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50437-blanchefleur-mirror-foa51007/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50437-blanchefleur-mirror-foa51007/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50437-blanchefleur-mirror-foa51007/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50437-blanchefleur-mirror-foa51007/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50437-blanchefleur-mirror-foa51007/5.jpg', 'If your walls trend more towards the darker tones, then this piece is the perfect match. This mirror looks like it is freshly cut out of a wooden slab, with white natural undertones that make it pop. What\'s even more astonishing is the variety in the relief details that go around the frame, seemingly random in style yet articulate. This durable solid wood piece could be at the heart of your next boho chic renovation.\n• Rustic\n• Weathered Light Natural Tone\n• Solid Wood\n• Hand-carved Patterns\n• Mango Hardwood\n• Rough Sawn Lumber\n• Natural Wood Grain\n• Fully Assembled', 379.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:30:04', '2026-10-07 02:30:04'),
(331, 1, 'foa-50460', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Pamphilos Dresser | FOA7144GY-D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/pamphilos-50460.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50460-pamphilos-dresser-foa7144gy-d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50460-pamphilos-dresser-foa7144gy-d/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Turn any bedroom into a luxurious get-away with this beautiful ensemble. A unique etched trim is the main visual centerpiece for the dresser, while traditional elements such as the bracket feet and bold reeded posts combine to create a sense of regality. In the same light, the trim molding and ornate nickel hardware that adorn the drawer panels inspire timelessness.\n• Traditional\n• Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Reeded Posts\n• Trim Molding\n• Bracket Feet\n• Nickel Round Knob & Hanging Pulls\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer', 979.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:30:11', '2026-10-07 02:30:11'),
(332, 1, 'foa-50468', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Pamphilos Dresser | FOA7144WH-D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/pamphilos-50468.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50468-pamphilos-dresser-foa7144wh-d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50468-pamphilos-dresser-foa7144wh-d/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Turn any bedroom into a luxurious get-away with this beautiful ensemble. A unique etched trim is the main visual centerpiece for the dresser, while traditional elements such as the bracket feet and bold reeded posts combine to create a sense of regality. In the same light, the trim molding and ornate nickel hardware that adorn the drawer panels inspire timelessness.\n• Traditional\n• Antique White\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Reeded Posts\n• Trim Molding\n• Bracket Feet\n• Nickel Round Knob & Hanging Pulls\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer', 979.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:30:17', '2026-10-07 02:30:17'),
(333, 1, 'foa-50482', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Laurentian Mirror | FOA7514M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/laurentian-50482.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50482-laurentian-mirror-foa7514m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50482-laurentian-mirror-foa7514m/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50482-laurentian-mirror-foa7514m/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50482-laurentian-mirror-foa7514m/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-50482-laurentian-mirror-foa7514m/5.jpg', 'Statement pieces are chosen to do just that--make a statement. And this mirror speaks for itself loud and clear. Its panels feature multiple deep grooves that run parallel from left to right, top to bottom, adding texture and more weight to an already visually hefty piece. The dark walnut finish gives this piece a bold presence that is hard to ignore.\n• Contemporary\n• Dark Walnut\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Laminated Veneer Lumber\n• Horizontal Panel Grooves\n• Wingback Design\n• Golden Finger Pulls\n• Jewelry Drawers on Chest and Dresser\n• Felt-lined Top Drawers\n• Foundation Required', 449.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 02:30:27', '2026-10-07 02:30:27'),
(334, 1, 'foa-49897', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Belleterre Dresser | CM7518D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/belleterre-49897.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49897-belleterre-dresser-cm7518d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49897-belleterre-dresser-cm7518d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49897-belleterre-dresser-cm7518d/3.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'Talking about taking glam to the next level! Straight lines and simple silhouettes are reminiscent of the modern era, but the stunning details bring it up a notch. Front panels feature a criss-crossing motif, adding texture to the set and will surely elevate any Hollywood-inspired room.\n• Glam\n• Silver\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Mirror, Others\n• Ball-bearing Glides\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer\n• Hidden Jewelry Drawer', 1319.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:30:33', '2026-10-07 02:30:33'),
(335, 1, 'foa-49910', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Alzir Mirror | CM7150BL-M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/alzir-49910.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49910-alzir-mirror-cm7150bl-m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49910-alzir-mirror-cm7150bl-m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Comforting cushioned velvet-like fabric encompasses this chic mirror. This camelback-designed mirror is the definition of decadent. A padded velvet-like fabric and diamond-like button tufted headboard compliment this glam design.\n• Glam\n• Blue\n• Velvet-Like Fabric, Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Padded Flannelette Fabric\n• Button Tufted\n• Crystal-like Acrylic Buttons', 209.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:30:39', '2026-10-07 02:30:39'),
(336, 1, 'foa-49865', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Valletta Dresser | FOA7157D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/valletta-49865.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49865-valletta-dresser-foa7157d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49865-valletta-dresser-foa7157d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49865-valletta-dresser-foa7157d/3.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'Gracing the panels of this dresser is an intricate play of radial and circular lines, engraved in polyresin material. Your eyes are drawn towards this beautiful pattern reminiscent of the art deco era. Mirror panels line each front edge, adding to the luxurious appeal. On top of that, the classy champagne finish exudes subtle warmth that makes this dresser, even in its grandeur, still plenty welcoming.\n• Glam\n• Champagne\n• Polyresin, Mirror, Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• 5mm Beveled Mirror\n• Decorative Pattern\n• Hidden Jewelry Drawer', 1029.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:30:47', '2026-10-07 02:30:47'),
(337, 1, 'foa-49874', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Regensburg Mirror | FOA7169M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/regensburg-49874.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49874-regensburg-mirror-foa7169m/1.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Take the rustic appeal of this mirror home with you! Simplistic in design but plenty in charm, this mirror will fit into any home.\n• Rustic\n• Dark Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others', 179.00, NULL, '*M', '2026-10-07 02:30:52', '2026-10-07 02:30:52'),
(338, 1, 'foa-49546', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Anneke Mirror | FOA7173M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/anneke-49546.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49546-anneke-mirror-foa7173m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49546-anneke-mirror-foa7173m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For the creative taste comes this very modern bedroom mirror with a distinct rustic flavor. It\'s a cohesive design of styles so unique it appeals to one\'s intellect and artistry. The distressed brushed finish brings out the brilliance of the grain. Decorative molding enhances the appearance of the dynamic, tapered frame. Everyone will enjoy their reflection in this classic visually pleasing item.\n• Transitional\n• Wire-Brushed Warm Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Square Mirror\n• Wire-brushed Finish', 179.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:30:59', '2026-10-07 02:30:59'),
(339, 1, 'foa-49557', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Larissa Dresser | CM7149D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/larissa-49557.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49557-larissa-dresser-cm7149d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49557-larissa-dresser-cm7149d/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This dresser reflects a special design achievement. It\'s a tasteful combination of rustic farmhouse styles and exquisite luxury, a modest-yet-striking theme of sophisticated grandeur. Oak-finished distressed wood and highlighted grain patterns offer fresh organic appeal. Ultra-modern construction and vintage accents - like black-steel drawer pulls and English dovetails - serve this uniquely-crafted piece of furniture.\n• Rustic\n• Natural Tone\n• Faux Wood Veneer, Others\n• Simple Modern Silhouette\n• Bar Drawer Pulls', 479.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:31:09', '2026-10-07 02:31:09'),
(340, 1, 'foa-49558', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Larissa Mirror | CM7149M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/larissa-49558.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49558-larissa-mirror-cm7149m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49558-larissa-mirror-cm7149m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This mirror reflects a larger special design achievement - a tasteful combination of rustic farmhouse styles and exquisite luxury for a modest-yet-striking theme of sophisticated grandeur. Oak-finished distressed wood and highlighted grain patterns offer fresh organic appeal. Ultra-modern construction benefits this uniquely-crafted piece of furniture.\n• Rustic\n• Natural Tone\n• Faux Wood Veneer, Others\n• Simple Modern Silhouette\n• Square Mirror', 119.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:31:15', '2026-10-07 02:31:15');
