(341, 1, 'foa-49573', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Carissa Dresser | CM7164D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/carissa-49573.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49573-carissa-dresser-cm7164d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49573-carissa-dresser-cm7164d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49573-carissa-dresser-cm7164d/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-49573-carissa-dresser-cm7164d/4.jpg', NULL, 'The ultimate Art Deco-inspired dresser! The elegance, glamour, unique shapes and vintage appeal of 1930\'s Hollywood is right here! The decadent gray velvet upholstery looks like it came right out of a classic old movie! There\'s a prestige with the unique design that seems to capture all of the excitement of a beloved bygone era! Additional embellishments such as rhombus chrome feet and diamond ring drawer-pulls faithfully enhance the cinematic reality.\n• Transitional\n• Gray\n• Fabric, Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Fully Upholstered Frame\n• Art Deco-inspired Design\n• Glass Top\n• Crystal-like Acrylic Knobs\n• Chrome Legs', 1109.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:31:25', '2026-10-07 02:31:25'),
(342, 1, 'foa-48897', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Keizer Mirror | FOA7603M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/keizer-48897.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48897-keizer-mirror-foa7603m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48897-keizer-mirror-foa7603m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The elusive appeal of an all solid wood mirror that is made entirely in the USA can be found right here. Products of our well documented \'Green\' commitment, we are extremely proud of both the quality and sustainability we\'ve observed with this high end mirror. Featuring a lush dark cherry finish, these are among our finest all-natural offerings perfect for those who still care about American pride and a healthy environment.', 969.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:31:31', '2026-10-07 02:31:31'),
(343, 1, 'foa-48911', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Bridgewater Mirror | FOA7490M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/bridgewater-48911.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48911-bridgewater-mirror-foa7490m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48911-bridgewater-mirror-foa7490m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For establishing an impressive identity in any bedroom, this is it! A mirror with a light walnut finish.\n• Transitional\n• Light Walnut\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Textured Wood Grain', 359.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:31:38', '2026-10-07 02:31:38'),
