(348, 1, 'foa-48964', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Tawana Dresser | FOA7918D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/tawana-48964.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48964-tawana-dresser-foa7918d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48964-tawana-dresser-foa7918d/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48964-tawana-dresser-foa7918d/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48964-tawana-dresser-foa7918d/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48964-tawana-dresser-foa7918d/5.jpg', 'This dresser has a classic squared motif that not only makes a great fashionable statement but it adds a sense of sophistication as well.\n• Transitional\n• Warm Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Felt-lined Top Drawers\n• Tapered Legs\n• Metal Pull Handles\n• Hidden Jewelry Drawer in Dresser\n• Ball Bearing Glides', 969.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 02:32:09', '2026-10-07 02:32:09'),
(349, 1, 'foa-48988', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Alyson Dresser | CM7962D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/alyson-48988.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48988-alyson-dresser-cm7962d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48988-alyson-dresser-cm7962d/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A distressed-white finish highlights this dresser and establishes a mood of antique integrity. Featuring French dovetail construction, felt-lined drawers, and a unique blend of cabinets, this is a dresser to not only enjoy but to take seriously. It is elegance defined.\n• Transitional\n• Distressed White, Walnut\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Plank Design\n• Metal Drawer Pulls', 1119.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:32:15', '2026-10-07 02:32:15'),
