(354, 1, 'foa-48315', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Sligo Mirror | FOA7893M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/sligo-48315.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-48315-sligo-mirror-foa7893m/1.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This mirror from the Sligo Bedroom Collection features a stunning dark gray finish.\n• Transitional\n• Dark Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others', 269.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 02:32:41', '2026-10-07 02:32:41'),
