(368, 1, 'foa-47413', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Deanne Mirror | CM7527WH-M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/deanne-47413.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-47413-deanne-mirror-cm7527wh-m/1.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A simple design with a couple of twisted helps set this modern bedroom set apart. The clean white finish has a hint of glossy to give it a nice sheen.\n• Minimalist Design', 169.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores', '2026-10-07 02:35:17', '2026-10-07 02:35:17'),
(369, 1, 'foa-46469', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Alanis Dresser | CM7579D', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/alanis-46469.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-46469-alanis-dresser-cm7579d/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-46469-alanis-dresser-cm7579d/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Avoid the contemporary aesthetic pitfall of feeling sterile and plain with this vibrant dresser. Mirror inserts trim the drawer faces to add an element that plays with light. Acrylic drawer pulls add a level of lightness and stay in the contemporary realm.\n• Contemporary\n• Light Gray\n• Mirror, Solid Wood, Others\n• Mirror Trim\n• Felt-lined Top Drawers\n• English Dovetail Drawer Construction\n• Jewelry Drawers in Dresser\n• Ball Bearing Metal Glides', 1329.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:35:23', '2026-10-07 02:35:23'),
(370, 1, 'foa-46499', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Amarantha Mirror | CM7362M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/amarantha-46499.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-46499-amarantha-mirror-cm7362m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-46499-amarantha-mirror-cm7362m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This square mirror takes a strong approach to the rustic bedroom aesthetic with heavy wooden tones. Minimally adorned save for a lovely wooden grain.\n• Burned Wood Design\n• English Dovetail Construction\n• Felt-Lined Top Drawers\n• Round Tapered Feet', 429.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 02:35:29', '2026-10-07 02:35:29'),
(371, 1, 'foa-46595', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Dresser', 'Hesperia Mirror | CM7441M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/dresser/hesperia-46595.html', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-46595-hesperia-mirror-cm7441m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Dresser/foa-46595-hesperia-mirror-cm7441m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Your humble abode awaits you. Design choices like carved pillar style corners frame you in a classic colonial aesthetic.\n• Nailhead Trim\n• Turned Wooden Legs', 219.00, NULL, '*', '2026-10-07 02:35:35', '2026-10-07 02:35:35'),
