(829, 1, 'foa-41249', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Media Chest', 'Litchville Media Chest | CM7383TV', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/media-chest/litchville-41249.html', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-41249-litchville-media-chest-cm7383tv/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-41249-litchville-media-chest-cm7383tv/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-41249-litchville-media-chest-cm7383tv/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-41249-litchville-media-chest-cm7383tv/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-41249-litchville-media-chest-cm7383tv/5.jpg', 'With smooth carved panels, this media chest will add a chic upgrade to your bedroom décor. A dark bold finish sets off the stylish design of the contrasting metal drawer pull handles. Felt-lined top drawers provide safe haven for more delicate possessions, hidden behind the bold paneling designs of each drawer front.\n• Transitional\n• Brown Cherry\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Felt-Lined Top Drawers\n• Hexagon Shaped Drawer Pulls\n• English Dovetail Drawer Construction', 809.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:37:48', '2026-10-07 04:37:48'),
(830, 1, 'foa-39521', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Media Chest', 'Mcville Media Chest | CM7558TV', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/media-chest/mcville-39521.html', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-39521-mcville-media-chest-cm7558tv/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-39521-mcville-media-chest-cm7558tv/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-39521-mcville-media-chest-cm7558tv/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-39521-mcville-media-chest-cm7558tv/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-39521-mcville-media-chest-cm7558tv/5.jpg', 'A trending design, industrial style is the latest in fabulous decorating ideas! This media chest features beautiful wood panels in dark oak finish adorned with metal legs and hardware.\n• Industrial Design\n• Felt-lined Top Drawers\n• Metal Hardware\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Dark Oak Finish', 719.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:37:49', '2026-10-07 04:37:49'),
(831, 1, 'foa-39239', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Bedroom', 'Media Chest', 'Loraine Media Chest | CM7195TV', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/bedroom/media-chest/loraine-39239.html', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-39239-loraine-media-chest-cm7195tv/1.png', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-39239-loraine-media-chest-cm7195tv/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-39239-loraine-media-chest-cm7195tv/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-39239-loraine-media-chest-cm7195tv/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Media Chest/foa-39239-loraine-media-chest-cm7195tv/5.jpg', 'This is what luxury feels and looks like. The padded leatherette headboard and footboard are beautifully complemented by antique mirror borders, which are also found on the case goods\' front panels. Stylish details like the nailhead trim, button tufting, ring drawer pulls, and champagne gray finish all add polish to this sophisticated bedroom set.\n• Glam\n• Champagne\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Antique Mirror Panels', 959.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 04:37:50', '2026-10-07 04:37:50'),
