(1011, 1, 'foa-51232', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Mirror', 'Alecia Mirror | CM7458WH-M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/mirror/alecia-51232.html', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-51232-alecia-mirror-cm7458wh-m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-51232-alecia-mirror-cm7458wh-m/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-51232-alecia-mirror-cm7458wh-m/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-51232-alecia-mirror-cm7458wh-m/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-51232-alecia-mirror-cm7458wh-m/5.jpg', 'The bell-shaped top edge with crown molding, combined with faux wood carved details that adorn the edges of this mirror, gives it a timeless look.\n• Transitional\n• White\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Bell-shape Design\n• Crown Molding\n• Faux Wood Carved Details', 339.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:20:43', '2026-10-07 05:20:43'),
(1012, 1, 'foa-51241', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Mirror', 'Zohar Mirror | CM7130PK-M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/mirror/zohar-51241.html', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-51241-zohar-mirror-cm7130pk-m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-51241-zohar-mirror-cm7130pk-m/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-51241-zohar-mirror-cm7130pk-m/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-51241-zohar-mirror-cm7130pk-m/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-51241-zohar-mirror-cm7130pk-m/5.jpg', 'Showcase your personal taste with this bold statement piece in your bedroom. Fully upholstered in flannelette, this mirror features padded fabric and crystal buttons.\n• Glam\n• Pink\n• Velvet-like, Solid Wood, Others\n• Fully Upholstered\n• Crystal-Like Acrylic Buttons', 279.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:20:45', '2026-10-07 05:20:45'),
(1013, 1, 'foa-50556', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Mirror', 'Myrtlemoore Mirror | EM7079IV-M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/mirror/myrtlemoore-50556.html', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50556-myrtlemoore-mirror-em7079iv-m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50556-myrtlemoore-mirror-em7079iv-m/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50556-myrtlemoore-mirror-em7079iv-m/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50556-myrtlemoore-mirror-em7079iv-m/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50556-myrtlemoore-mirror-em7079iv-m/5.jpg', 'This lighter tone mirror will be a great addition to any farmhouse space. Between the light vintage ivory frame to the contrasting rustic gray crown moldings, it exudes irresistible charm. And then there\'s the attention to detail: it is meticulously hand-painted and hand-finished for that exotic distressed look. Finally, the mirror is made of sustainably sourced pine wood.\n• Rustic\n• Vintage Ivory/Rustic Gray\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• FSC Certified Solid Wood Brazilian Pine\n• Carved Wooden Floral Accents\n• Hand-painted with Non-toxic Water-Based Paint\n• Distressed Finish & Finished Backside', 479.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:20:47', '2026-10-07 05:20:47'),
(1014, 1, 'foa-50598', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Mirror', 'Geneva Mirror | EM7080IV-M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/mirror/geneva-50598.html', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50598-geneva-mirror-em7080iv-m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50598-geneva-mirror-em7080iv-m/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50598-geneva-mirror-em7080iv-m/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50598-geneva-mirror-em7080iv-m/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50598-geneva-mirror-em7080iv-m/5.jpg', 'This mirror is a definite showstopper. The subdued ivory color, which is hand-painted and hand-finished, brings out the beauty of the solid Brazilian pine wood. The result is a mirror that\'s nothing short of exotic.\n• Contemporary\n• Ivory\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• FSC Certified Solid Wood Brazilian Pine\n• Hand-painted with Non-toxic Water-based Paint\n• Finished Backside', 399.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:20:50', '2026-10-07 05:20:50'),
(1015, 1, 'foa-50643', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Mirror', 'Magdeburg Mirror | FOA7038BK-M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/mirror/magdeburg-50643.html', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50643-magdeburg-mirror-foa7038bk-m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-50643-magdeburg-mirror-foa7038bk-m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For a minimalistic space, this ensemble sets the perfect tone. With a sleek high gloss finish, each piece exudes a sense of confidence that\'s hard to ignore. The straight and sleek lines highlight the simple, yet inviting silhouette.\n• Contemporary\n• Black\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• High Gloss Finish', 169.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 05:20:51', '2026-10-07 05:20:51'),
