(1018, 1, 'foa-49595', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Mirror', 'Vevey Mirror | FOA7175M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/mirror/vevey-49595.html', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-49595-vevey-mirror-foa7175m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-49595-vevey-mirror-foa7175m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For the young person with burgeoning style, here is a refined, large mirror befit of maturing taste. A rich wood grain texture highlights the construction. The no frills molding speaks to a greater efficiency - it can sit freely or be hung upon a wall. An attractive and sturdy piece, it\'s the ideal addition to accommodate necessity and style.\n• Transitional\n• Wire-Brushed Warm Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Wood Grain Texture', 199.00, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-07 05:21:25', '2026-10-07 05:21:25'),
(1019, 1, 'foa-49607', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Mirror', 'Belva Mirror | CM7174M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/mirror/belva-49607.html', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-49607-belva-mirror-cm7174m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-49607-belva-mirror-cm7174m/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-49607-belva-mirror-cm7174m/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-49607-belva-mirror-cm7174m/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-49607-belva-mirror-cm7174m/5.jpg', 'For those that prefer a taste of the exquisite, this mirror fulfills that desire - and then some. It is majestic splendor on display, boasting an assortment of novel embellishments. Identical turnip feet, unique trim, and wood-carved floral designs combine to create a lovely theme, a unique French / Olde English style that serves as the perfect enhancement, never failing to elevate the stature of any room.\n• Traditional\n• White\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Elegant Molding & Trim Accents', 289.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:21:27', '2026-10-07 05:21:27'),
