(1021, 1, 'foa-48433', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Mirror', 'Allie Mirror | CM7901M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/mirror/allie-48433.html', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-48433-allie-mirror-cm7901m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-48433-allie-mirror-cm7901m/2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This mirror from the Allie Collection is one the kids can grow with. The pearl white finish, classic design, and metal accents pair well with any color, ensuring that this set will match whatever phase they encounter.\n• Contemporary\n• Pearl White\n• Acrylic, Solid Wood, Others\n• Mirror w/ LED Light', 429.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to', '2026-10-07 05:21:30', '2026-10-07 05:21:30'),
(1022, 1, 'foa-46773', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Mirror', 'Avior Mirror | CM7170RG-M', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/mirror/avior-46773.html', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-46773-avior-mirror-cm7170rg-m/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-46773-avior-mirror-cm7170rg-m/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-46773-avior-mirror-cm7170rg-m/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-46773-avior-mirror-cm7170rg-m/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Mirror/foa-46773-avior-mirror-cm7170rg-m/5.jpg', 'Brighten your bedroom with the glamour and glitz of this elegant bedroom set! Stylish button tufts decorate the padded leatherette headboard, bringing extra definition to each piece while accentuating the thick wood frame. Beautiful mirrored accent panels enhance the visual appeal of the case good design while the turned bun feet provide sturdy support while adding a sophisticated touch to this set\'s chic contemporary elements.\n• Contemporary\n• Rose Gold\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others', 299.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:21:31', '2026-10-07 05:21:31'),
