(973, 1, 'foa-51790', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Nightstand', 'Lycorida Night Stand | CM7477GY-N', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/nightstand/lycorida-51790.html', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-51790-lycorida-night-stand-cm7477gy-n/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-51790-lycorida-night-stand-cm7477gy-n/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-51790-lycorida-night-stand-cm7477gy-n/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-51790-lycorida-night-stand-cm7477gy-n/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-51790-lycorida-night-stand-cm7477gy-n/5.jpg', 'Framing the bed and case good panels are raised molding details, adding contour to an otherwise flat design. Boasting dovetail drawers and ball-bearing glides, the drawers are smooth and feature some flair with sleek, chrome pulls. The light gray finish makes for a great gender-neutral option for any family wanting to upgrade their kids\' space.\n• Transitional\n• Gray\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Molding Details\n• Dovetail Drawers\n• Ball-bearing Glides\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer\n• Chrome Hanging Pulls', 279.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:10:36', '2026-10-07 05:10:36'),
(974, 1, 'foa-51611', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Nightstand', 'Priam Night Stand | CM7467WH-N', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/nightstand/priam-51611.html', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-51611-priam-night-stand-cm7467wh-n/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-51611-priam-night-stand-cm7467wh-n/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-51611-priam-night-stand-cm7467wh-n/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-51611-priam-night-stand-cm7467wh-n/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-51611-priam-night-stand-cm7467wh-n/5.jpg', 'This unique two-tone chest is perfect for a young child. The front panels all feature slat designs, which combined with the black metal bar handles offer a bit of Mission style flair. The striking contrast between the gray tops and edges and white frames updates this night stand into more of a contemporary look.\n• Contemporary\n• White/Gray\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• Two-tone Color\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer\n• Ball Bearing Glides\n• Dovetail Drawers', 279.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:10:37', '2026-10-07 05:10:37'),
(975, 1, 'foa-50599', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Nightstand', 'Geneva Night Stand | EM7080IV-N', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/nightstand/geneva-50599.html', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-50599-geneva-night-stand-em7080iv-n/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-50599-geneva-night-stand-em7080iv-n/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-50599-geneva-night-stand-em7080iv-n/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-50599-geneva-night-stand-em7080iv-n/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-50599-geneva-night-stand-em7080iv-n/5.jpg', 'This night stand is a definite showstopper. An etched wooden sunburst pattern serves as the focus, grabbing everyone\'s attention. What keeps the flamboyant centerpiece in check is the rather subdued ivory color, hand-painted and hand-finished to bring out the beauty of the solid Brazilian pine wood. The result is a night stand that\'s nothing short of exotic.\n• Contemporary\n• Ivory\n• Solid Wood, Others\n• FSC Certified Solid Wood Brazilian Pine\n• Wood Carved Sunburst Headboard Design\n• Hand-painted with Non-toxic Water-based Paint\n• English Dovetail Drawers with Ball-bearing Metal Side Glides\n• Hidden Finger Pulls\n• Heavy Duty Door Hinges & Hook-on Rails\n• Finished Backside', 669.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:10:38', '2026-10-07 05:10:38'),
