(977, 1, 'foa-49596', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Nightstand', 'Vevey Night Stand | FOA7175N', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/nightstand/vevey-49596.html', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-49596-vevey-night-stand-foa7175n/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-49596-vevey-night-stand-foa7175n/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-49596-vevey-night-stand-foa7175n/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-49596-vevey-night-stand-foa7175n/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-49596-vevey-night-stand-foa7175n/5.jpg', 'For the young person with burgeoning style, here is a refined night stand befit of maturing taste. A rich wood grain texture highlights the construction. No frills molding and spacious drawers speak to a greater efficiency. Black metal drawer pulls are attached firmly for easy operation. An attractive an sturdy piece, it\'s the ideal addition to accommodate necessity and style.\n• Transitional\n• Wire-Brushed Warm Gray\n• Solid Wood, Wood Veneer, Others\n• Felt-lined Top Drawer\n• Round Pull Knobs\n• Wood Grain Texture', 329.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:10:40', '2026-10-07 05:10:40'),
(978, 1, 'foa-49619', 'foagroup.com', 'foagroup.com', 'Youth', 'Nightstand', 'Ampelios Night Stand | AM7000BK-N', 'https://www.foagroup.com/categories/youth/nightstand/ampelios-49619.html', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-49619-ampelios-night-stand-am7000bk-n/1.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-49619-ampelios-night-stand-am7000bk-n/2.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-49619-ampelios-night-stand-am7000bk-n/3.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-49619-ampelios-night-stand-am7000bk-n/4.jpg', 'Images/foagroup/Nightstand/foa-49619-ampelios-night-stand-am7000bk-n/5.jpg', 'The combination of plank style construction and weathered barn finish in this bedroom set will help you create a casual, comfortable bedroom haven. American pine wood construction ensures lasting beauty and durability. Available pieces include everything you need to accommodate your space, including a six-drawer dresser, nightstand, coordinating mirror, and five drawer chest.\n• Rustic\n• Wire-Brushed Black\n• Pine Wood, Others\n• Rustic\n• Plank Style Design\n• Metal Pulls\n• American Pine Construction', 419.00, NULL, '*Manufacturer\'s Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) is not the actual price offered at the local stores. MSRP does not apply to stores outside the United States.', '2026-10-07 05:10:41', '2026-10-07 05:10:41'),
